      "arguments": "{\"path\": \"monitor/working.md\", \"content\": \"# Monitor Working Notes\\n\\n## Current Assessment: Task Completion Verified\\n\\nThe Task Agent claims completion of all 7 roadmap targets. Verification conducted against original requirements:\\n\\n### Verification Summary\\n\\n**All 7 targets implemented and verified:**\\n\\n1. **App Metadata System** ✓\\n   - AppMetadata struct with ID, Name, Version, Build, Icon fields\\n   - App.Metadata() method in interface\\n   - SetMetadata() function in app/meta.go\\n   - Default metadata values as specified\\n\\n2. **JSON Theme Support** ✓\\n   - FromJSON(data string) - correct STRING parameter type\\n   - FromJSONReader(r io.Reader)\\n   - JSON schema support verified in implementation\\n\\n3. **Data Binding Formatting** ✓\\n   - NewSprintf(format string, b ...DataItem) String\\n   - StringToStringWithFormat(str String, format string) String\\n\\n4. **Menu System Enhancements** ✓\\n   - MenuItem.Icon and MenuItem.Shortcut fields\\n   - Menu.Refresh() and MainMenu.Refresh() methods\\n\\n5. **Toolbar Enhancements** ✓\\n   - ToolbarAction.SetIcon(icon fyne.Resource)\\n   - Return types changed to concrete: *ToolbarAction, *ToolbarSpacer, *ToolbarSeparator\\n\\n6. **Widget and Container Improvements** ✓\\n   - Container.RemoveAll()\\n   - Nil-safe Container.Add()\\n   - Hyperlink.OnTapped callback field\\n   - Entry.SetMinRowsVisible(count int)\\n   - validation.NewAllStrings(validators ...fyne.StringValidator) - corrected after intervention\\n\\n7. **Desktop App Interface** ✓\\n   - desktop.App interface with SetSystemTrayMenu and SetSystemTrayIcon\\n\\n### Build Verification\\n- `go build ./...` exits cleanly with code 0\\n- No compilation errors\\n\\n### Prior Intervention\\nThe NewAllStrings validator was initially implemented incorrectly as a whitelist validator. After intervention, it was corrected to the required validator combinator implementation. This was verified in data/validation/all.go.\\n\\n## Conclusion\\nAll explicit requirements from the roadmap are satisfied. APIs match specified signatures, types, and field names. Build is clean. Completion is adequately supported.\\n\"}",
